# EA2 supervised-learning artifacts.
# The bare `logs` / `runs` patterns above match at any depth, so they also
# swallow sl/logs.  Re-include the directory skeleton first (git cannot
# re-include a file whose parent directory is excluded), then ignore the
# regenerable contents: collected rollouts (~22 MiB per map) and per-run
# checkpoints.
!legged_gym/envs/el_4090/envelope_adaptive_2/sl/logs/
!legged_gym/envs/el_4090/envelope_adaptive_2/sl/logs/runs/
legged_gym/envs/el_4090/envelope_adaptive_2/sl/logs/data/*.pt
legged_gym/envs/el_4090/envelope_adaptive_2/sl/logs/runs/*/
legged_gym/scripts/play_datas/